{#
  map_emissions.j2
  ================
  Verbal reading of the surface-water emissions map for one scenario.

  Context variables (from _build_map_emissions_ctx):
    available           False when the scenario produced no emission output
    e                   report_outputs.compute_emissions_stats() result
    has_change, change_pct, increased, magnitude   comparison with the baseline
#}
{% if available %}
The map below shows where pathogens enter surface water in this scenario. Total modelled emissions reach {{ e.total | sci }} {{ e.unit }}{% if has_change %}, {{ magnitude }} {{ "higher" if increased else "lower" }} than the baseline by {{ change_pct | num }}%{% endif %}.

{% if e.dominant_source %}
The largest pathway is {{ e.dominant_source.label }}, responsible for {{ e.dominant_source.pct | num }}% of the load. Across the three compartments the model attributes {{ e.human_pct | num }}% to human excreta that reaches water directly, {{ e.wwtp_pct | num }}% to the effluent discharged by wastewater treatment plants, and {{ e.land_pct | num }}% to runoff from land.
{% endif %}

{% if e.sanitation %}
Within the human contribution, {{ e.dominant_sanitation.label }} is the single largest source, at {{ e.dominant_sanitation.pct | num }}% of everything released by human excreta. The leading facility types are:

{% for row in e.sanitation %}
- **{{ row.label | capitalize }}**: {{ row.pct | num }}% of the human load ({{ row.value | sci }})
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if e.livestock %}
The land compartment is dominated by livestock manure, with {{ e.dominant_livestock.label }} accounting for {{ e.dominant_livestock.pct | num }}% of the livestock load. The largest contributors are {{ e.livestock | map(attribute='label') | list | listjoin }}.
{% endif %}

{% if e.top_areas %}
Emissions are spatially concentrated. The {{ e.top_areas | length }} highest-emitting areas together release {{ e.top_areas_pct | num }}% of the study-area total, spread over {{ e.area_count }} reporting areas in all:

{% for row in e.top_areas %}
- **{{ row.name }}**: {{ row.pct | num }}% of total emissions ({{ row.value | sci }})
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
